OL,3,GNEWSA'Playing politics' row over town  
OL,4,Arevamp plan                            
OL,6,FA political row has broken out over a  
OL,7,F#30m town centre regeneration scheme.  
OL,9,FLabour-led Stockton Council agreed a   
OL,10,Fplan to buy areas of Billingham town   
OL,11,Fcentre from a private developer for    
OL,12,F#13m, so redevelopment work could      
OL,13,Fbegin.                                 
OL,15,FConservative councillors have since    
OL,16,Fcalled in the proposals, saying the    
OL,17,Fdeal needs further scrutiny to make    
OL,18,Fsure taxpayers get value for money. It 
OL,19,Fwill now be examined by the council's  
OL,20,Fexecutive scrutiny committee.          
